{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0312_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0312_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1cc068cc47f1fadca6af4dd939e9ff56d766ddc335b8b77eb3f7bbae03b16296", "ja": "（ひなたが出演する舞台の稽古が終わった。\n次は収録があるから、すぐに移動しないとな！）", "zh": "（日向出演的舞台剧排练结束了。接下来还有录音，得马上赶过去才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0312_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0312_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "7d1e1eee7c776ff1898872823eef5845c1f56269394f62d61ebf31a3baa85fc1", "ja": "ええっとぉ……ここから近くの駅に行って……\nふんふん……赤い色の路線が目印なんだねぇ。", "zh": "呃……从这里去附近的车站，然后……\n嗯嗯……以红色的线路为标志啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0312_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0312_1002_p", "source_sha256": "02050c71e6a8a938d2418f070547e7a2a096a46e6ef953f3d666acf879d477d5", "ja": "どうしたんだ、ひなた。\nそれは……電車の乗り換え案内サイトか？", "zh": "怎么了，日向。\n那是……电车换乘查询网站吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0312_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0312_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "e7d145a65fede03cbe73225014037547c05f3214c8c46263826539a2835bcce3", "ja": "そうだよぉ。この間のお花見で、\nみんなに迷惑かけちゃったから……。", "zh": "是呀～因为上次赏花的时候，给大家添麻烦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0312_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0312_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "e25ea436d66d247916c1dd00ab3f4cc9d6f4cf7853603e2f24f791af668d461f", "ja": "今度は迷わないように、しっかり調べてたんだ。\n次の現場は、あたしひとりで行かなきゃだからねぇ。", "zh": "为了这次不迷路，我可是好好查过了。\n因为下次得我一个人去现场呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0312_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0312_1005_p", "source_sha256": "234ffb77cf4d2df51f106fe76622fd8c6e0845f70f49d6660be41a30c59687bf", "ja": "それなんだが……。実は予定が変わってね。\n次の現場に一緒に行けることになったんだ。", "zh": "是这样……其实行程有变。\n我可以和你一起去下一个工作现场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0312_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0312_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "b880066b5d1a79713b672dad072bfe3e9ad931b1a1a6a83c2c2b886da3dc84a9", "ja": "わぁ、本当かい？\n{$P$}が一緒なら、心強いよ♪", "zh": "哇，真的吗？\n有{$P$}一起去的话，我就放心啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0312_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0312_1007_p", "source_sha256": "01c573ac5c1d66733324ced800492f417991353b50c8980ea3dff6eef4a6f923", "ja": "そうだ！　せっかく行き方を調べたんだ。\n今日はひなたに道案内をお願いしてもいいかな？", "zh": "对了！难得查好了路线。\n今天可以拜托小日向来带路吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0312_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0312_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "d7b6a67ad5d4dca2c5394a0f65b874afa950d7792758c6df44a51cb8c6e7ff4a", "ja": "あ、あたしがかい？　案内するのはいいけど……\n道を間違えたら、すぐに教えてねぇ？", "zh": "啊，是让我来吗？带路倒是没问题……\n要是走错路了，可要马上告诉我哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0312_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0312_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c7dae6230eb8714e992add46fe96952153379edef11c0103a13bfb990e7ab09e", "ja": "（ひなたの丁寧な道案内で、時間通り現場に到着した。\n……ちょっとは、ひなたの自信になったかな？）", "zh": "（在日向细致的带路下，我们准时抵达了现场。\n……这多少也让日向更有自信了吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
